# js/materialx/<version>/: only the default MaterialX version (see
# DEFAULT_MTLX_VERSION in scripts/lib/mtlx-versions.mjs) is committed to
# git. Every other pinned version is fetched on demand by
# `npm run vendor:versions` (scripts/fetch-mtlx-versions.mjs) and
# intentionally left out of the repo. Explicit per-version lines rather
# than a negation pattern — negation is fragile for directories.
